-- akn:art_6 The heading of §6.
-- akn:art_6__para_6-1 akn:art_6__para_6-2 akn:art_6__para_6-3 The headings of 6.1, 6.2 and 6.3.

-- 6.1: the lending employer lends the teacher to the other for the hours
-- he teaches in its classes.
@ref akn:art_6__para_6-1/p1
