    MUST  `sign the letter of consent`

§§ `8 מורים לא קבועים`

-- akn:art_8 The heading of §8.
-- akn:art_8__para_8-1 akn:art_8__para_8-2 akn:art_8__para_8-3 The headings of 8.1, 8.2 and 8.3.

-- 8.1: it does not apply to a teacher permanent with neither employer
-- (`the lending employer of` gives none). 8.2: to secure his rights, the
-- principal tries to place him in one division only; 8.3: or else at a
-- third of a position in one of them at least.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-1/p1
GIVEN t IS A `1982 lent teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1982 lending agreement reaches the teacher's tenure` t IF
    t's `permanent with the State` OR t's `permanent with the local authority`

@ref akn:art_8__para_8-2/p1 akn:art_8__para_8-3/p1
GIVEN `placed in one division only` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `1982 teacher-lending action`
DECIDE `placing a teacher without tenure` `placed in one division only` IS
    IF `placed in one division only`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the school principal`
         MUST  `try to place a teacher without tenure at a third of a position in one division`

`the principal tries one division first` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `try to place a teacher without tenure in one division only`

§§ `9 תחילת תוקפו של ההסכם וביטול הסכם איחוד המשכורות`

-- akn:art_9 The heading of §9.
-- akn:art_9__para_9-1 akn:art_9__para_9-2 akn:art_9__para_9-3 The headings of 9.1, 9.2 and 9.3.

-- 9.1: it applies from 1.9.1982, and also to teachers whose salary was
-- merged by the agreement of 4.2.1975 — those retiring on 31.8.1982 among
-- them — back to when it was first merged; ¶2: the employer that merged it
