    CONSIDER `his salary was merged under the agreement of 4.2.1975 from`
    WHEN JUST m THEN d `is on or after` m
    WHEN NOTHING THEN d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1982)

GIVEN `the employer that merged his salary` IS A `employer in a six-year school, of 1982`
GIVETH A `employer in a six-year school, of 1982`
DECIDE `the lending employer of a merged teacher` `the employer that merged his salary` IS
    `the employer that merged his salary`

#ASSERT `the 1982 lending agreement applies to the teacher on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1980) (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1977))
#ASSERT NOT `the 1982 lending agreement applies to the teacher on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1980) NOTHING

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-2/p1
GIVEN `the lending began` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `6.2's reckoning reaches the lending period from` `the lending began` IF
    `the lending began` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1982)

@ref akn:art_9__para_9-3/p1
`the salary-merging agreement of 4.2.1975 stands after 1.9.1982` MEANS FALSE

