-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/t1 The signing formula, the signatures and the parties signing; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' — רשימת בתי-הספר`

-- akn:attachments The annexes' frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1 The list of the six-year schools §2 sends to, by name and place (220 lines, some of them illegible and some printed twice); the list is the data §2's `on annex א's list as updated` reads, and carries no rule of its own.

§§ `נספח ב' — סדרי ההתחשבנות`

-- ¶1: the annex is the reckoning 6.2 sends to. §1: every year, for each
-- school of annex א', two lists — the teachers whose lending employer is
-- the Ministry (1.1), and those whose lending employer is the local
-- authority (1.2) — with identity numbers, their hours in the middle and
-- the upper division, grade and seniority. §2: from them a third list of
-- the hours the employers reckon for. §3.1: the district manager's
-- representative, the authority's and the principal draw them up, and the
-- district manager, the principal and the authority's representative
-- approve them; 3.2: the district's and the authority's treasurers check
-- them, and the district's sends them, in September each year, to the
-- Ministry's chief salaries coordinator; 3.3: who sees to the reckoning at
-- the rate the planning division gives him; 3.4: in September each year,
-- on the year before's report.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_3
`drawing up the yearly lists` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `draw up the yearly lists of lent teachers`

`the month the reckoning is made in` MEANS 9

-- §4.1: the lending employer is owed the hours the teacher taught for the
-- other employer times the rate for a teaching hour. 4.2: the rate is
-- agreed between the Centre of Local Government and the Ministry's planning
-- division, by the school's average grade and seniority profile in the
-- upper division, as the salaries system sets; 4.3: counting every
-- component of pay, pensions among them, as accepted in secondary education
-- and in the salaries booklet as its committee updates it; 4.4: updated
-- every year on a day the employers agree. The rate is an input.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_4
GIVEN `hours he taught for the other employer` IS A NUMBER
      `the rate for a teaching hour` IS A NUMBER @desc agreed by the Centre of Local Government and the Ministry's planning division, by annex ב' §4.2–4.4
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what the lending employer is owed under annex ב'` `hours he taught for the other employer` `the rate for a teaching hour` IS
    `hours he taught for the other employer` TIMES `the rate for a teaching hour`

#ASSERT `what the lending employer is owed under annex ב'` 200 50 EQUALS 10000

-- §5: the principal reports to the employers the teachers' presence in the
-- two divisions, every year at the opening of the school year and in it on
-- a change, so the teacher is paid by his actual employment whatever the
-- reckoning; stay hours are paid by the stay-hours agreement of the
-- director-general's circular of 26.5.1981 (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_5
`reporting the teachers' presence` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `report the teachers' presence in the two divisions`

-- §6: the reckoning runs for a trial of two years and is reviewed at its
-- end.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_6 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_6/p2
`the trial years of annex ב's reckoning` MEANS 2

-- §7: claims to compensation of teachers dismissed, or whose position was
-- cut, beyond what the law or the unions' agreements require, are decided
-- by a joint committee of the Ministry and the Centre of Local Government,
-- binding on both; ¶2: the lending owner and the owner where his salary is
-- merged each bear the added cost by his position share with each.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_7 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_7/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_7/p3
GIVEN `the added cost` IS A NUMBER, `his position share with this owner` IS A NUMBER, `his whole position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an owner's part of the added compensation under annex ב'` `the added cost` `his position share with this owner` `his whole position` IS
    `the added cost` TIMES `his position share with this owner` DIVIDED BY `his whole position`

#ASSERT `an owner's part of the added compensation under annex ב'` 9000 (1 DIVIDED BY 3) 1 EQUALS 3000

§§ `נספח ג' — כתב הסכמה`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1 The form of the letter of consent §7 asks for: the teacher confirms he read the agreement, consents to it and names his employer from a date, and the principal confirms he signed before him; with where the signed copies go. The form carries no rule beyond §7's.

§§ `נספח ד' — כתב הצטרפות`

-- akn:att_4__hc_1 The form of the letter of joining §12 offers, under §9(2) of the Collective Agreements Law: the employer joins the agreement and accepts the Ministry's instructions under it; with where the signed copies go. The form carries no rule beyond §12's.
